An `@param` on a class or on a property is `E0333`, since only a function has parameters — `rule:tooling/doc-comment-tags-are-closed-and-checked`
--FILE--
<?nvs
// `@param` goes only on a function.
/// A list of entries.
///
/// @param $amount not a parameter of anything
final class Ledger {
    /// The total so far.
